{
  "bvid": "BV1FPf2BVEu6",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "64866c604169d987ab255d5d40bb89d282ccd0873724962954d41f1e4a8baf6f",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 500,
      "end_ms": 2620,
      "text": "哎我们现在讲这个暗语体系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2620,
      "end_ms": 5280,
      "text": "这革命内丹术啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 5280,
      "end_ms": 8700,
      "text": "那么要讲的就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 14980,
      "end_ms": 23530,
      "text": "唉但鼠呃要结单的一个哎呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 26800,
      "end_ms": 29180,
      "text": "就是大小周天已经讲过了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 29180,
      "end_ms": 31100,
      "text": "大小周天你们自己去看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 31100,
      "end_ms": 32619,
      "text": "周天已经讲过了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 32619,
      "end_ms": 34670,
      "text": "那么现在目的是为了结单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 34670,
      "end_ms": 38050,
      "text": "接待们要做的一个比较重要的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 38050,
      "end_ms": 41249,
      "text": "是要就是要呼吸催动真气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 41249,
      "end_ms": 45440,
      "text": "然后让这个蒸气要凝结啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 46080,
      "end_ms": 49940,
      "text": "你知道要吐纳吐纳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 49940,
      "end_ms": 51620,
      "text": "然后以几个基本概念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 51620,
      "end_ms": 55019,
      "text": "还有是要催动什么蒸汽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 55019,
      "end_ms": 58899,
      "text": "然后这个吐纳要发展到这个是胎息啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 58899,
      "end_ms": 61100,
      "text": "对胎息"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 63300,
      "end_ms": 65580,
      "text": "胎息的一个程度"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 75960,
      "end_ms": 78600,
      "text": "哦这个这个还比较烦呐"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 78600,
      "end_ms": 80600,
      "text": "这个蒸汽后面还有是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 80600,
      "end_ms": 86480,
      "text": "要有什么什么谦恭相配啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 87750,
      "end_ms": 88590,
      "text": "铅汞啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 89870,
      "end_ms": 91750,
      "text": "铅汞相配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 94400,
      "end_ms": 97920,
      "text": "那我们今天讲主要讲这个吐纳和胎息啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 97920,
      "end_ms": 100480,
      "text": "吐纳指的是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 101130,
      "end_ms": 103490,
      "text": "呼吸时的气是什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 104610,
      "end_ms": 105370,
      "text": "生机啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 105370,
      "end_ms": 107330,
      "text": "深深肌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 107650,
      "end_ms": 113430,
      "text": "因为除了革命战术里面这个修修士"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 113430,
      "end_ms": 116620,
      "text": "或者说我们叫这个修仙的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 116620,
      "end_ms": 120720,
      "text": "他其实就是一个团体啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 120720,
      "end_ms": 121420,
      "text": "是个团体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 121420,
      "end_ms": 123860,
      "text": "或者说更确定是个革命团体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 123860,
      "end_ms": 127060,
      "text": "这个修仙者啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 127860,
      "end_ms": 129539,
      "text": "修仙者就是革命团体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 129539,
      "end_ms": 130340,
      "text": "革命团体的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 130340,
      "end_ms": 134020,
      "text": "他通过吐纳吞吐生机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 135360,
      "end_ms": 136600,
      "text": "吞吐生机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 136600,
      "end_ms": 139120,
      "text": "什么叫吞吐生鸡呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 140320,
      "end_ms": 144700,
      "text": "就是死就是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 144700,
      "end_ms": 146100,
      "text": "简单一点就是散财货"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 147420,
      "end_ms": 150040,
      "text": "散财货以养人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 150480,
      "end_ms": 152940,
      "text": "就是要土纳呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 152940,
      "end_ms": 153900,
      "text": "纳的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 153900,
      "end_ms": 154920,
      "text": "纳进来是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 156200,
      "end_ms": 157100,
      "text": "那就是人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 157100,
      "end_ms": 158400,
      "text": "纳人才啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 158400,
      "end_ms": 159690,
      "text": "土纳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 160950,
      "end_ms": 165670,
      "text": "那实际上就是这个一个就是经费流"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 170790,
      "end_ms": 174450,
      "text": "经费流和人才池吐纳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 174450,
      "end_ms": 176470,
      "text": "那么你的下丹田里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 176470,
      "end_ms": 179485,
      "text": "我们的人才池就是下丹田啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 180460,
      "end_ms": 182420,
      "text": "那么这个经费流呢运转起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 182420,
      "end_ms": 187420,
      "text": "这经费流呢就是嗯搬的这个合车"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 191260,
      "end_ms": 195400,
      "text": "然后说要吐纳吐纳到什么程度啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 195400,
      "end_ms": 197530,
      "text": "就是胎息的程度"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 197530,
      "end_ms": 203970,
      "text": "也就是要使得你的经费流胎息的程度要地下化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 204570,
      "end_ms": 206930,
      "text": "经费流调到地下化这个程度"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 206930,
      "end_ms": 208950,
      "text": "然后呢这个要精纯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 208950,
      "end_ms": 210910,
      "text": "也就是经费流得精纯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 210910,
      "end_ms": 212830,
      "text": "不能有来路不明的经费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 212830,
      "end_ms": 216840,
      "text": "或者说不能有就是是杂质啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 217920,
      "end_ms": 224490,
      "text": "你的所吸进来的这个嘶啊不能有杂质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 224490,
      "end_ms": 226230,
      "text": "也就是说钱不能来路不明"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 226230,
      "end_ms": 231255,
      "text": "或者说他有这个这个不纯动机啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 231770,
      "end_ms": 234370,
      "text": "啊得有精纯的经费流"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 235460,
      "end_ms": 237100,
      "text": "还有人才池"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 237100,
      "end_ms": 243930,
      "text": "是把这个相应的这个先天的元气真气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 243930,
      "end_ms": 248050,
      "text": "要收敛储藏在下丹田啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 248050,
      "end_ms": 250410,
      "text": "收敛储藏在这个下丹田"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 250410,
      "end_ms": 254360,
      "text": "那么这个下丹田那就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 255580,
      "end_ms": 257500,
      "text": "哎呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 260040,
      "end_ms": 260959,
      "text": "金拱相配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 260959,
      "end_ms": 262760,
      "text": "然后炼出真金啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 264120,
      "end_ms": 268820,
      "text": "下丹田是你的金银部类啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 271000,
      "end_ms": 272580,
      "text": "就是你的经营部垒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 272580,
      "end_ms": 275980,
      "text": "或者说这个下单的就是你赚钱的营生啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 275980,
      "end_ms": 277560,
      "text": "赚钱营生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 278960,
      "end_ms": 284210,
      "text": "赚钱的经营部类的人才池一般是储存在这里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 284210,
      "end_ms": 289570,
      "text": "将你的人才池储存在这个经营部类当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 290800,
      "end_ms": 293240,
      "text": "哇这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 297620,
      "end_ms": 301160,
      "text": "然后就是通过经费流啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 301160,
      "end_ms": 306159,
      "text": "然后通过这个文武火的呼吸啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 306479,
      "end_ms": 311980,
      "text": "文武火也是这个里边这个是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 313500,
      "end_ms": 316780,
      "text": "你要去把本来不是人才的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 316780,
      "end_ms": 318540,
      "text": "就是把先天浊气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 319780,
      "end_ms": 322100,
      "text": "先天浊气啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 323259,
      "end_ms": 324939,
      "text": "啊后天浊气说错了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 324939,
      "end_ms": 328479,
      "text": "后天的浊气通过这个走合车的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 328479,
      "end_ms": 333450,
      "text": "把它变成啊先天的先天的真气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 333450,
      "end_ms": 336550,
      "text": "那么我们说的这个走合车"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 336550,
      "end_ms": 340750,
      "text": "我们这个这个大小周天已经讲过了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 340750,
      "end_ms": 343630,
      "text": "走合车走过的是哪些穴道啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 343630,
      "end_ms": 348720,
      "text": "我们这是说文火和武火啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 348720,
      "end_ms": 355110,
      "text": "文武火就是从下从下往上往上走"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 355110,
      "end_ms": 359109,
      "text": "走到这个是头顶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 359109,
      "end_ms": 361749,
      "text": "从然后就再从嘴巴下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 361749,
      "end_ms": 363369,
      "text": "从嘴巴下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 363369,
      "end_ms": 367015,
      "text": "然后再再回回到这个丹田"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 367740,
      "end_ms": 370240,
      "text": "回到丹田呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 370240,
      "end_ms": 371760,
      "text": "他是先从泥弯弓啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 371760,
      "end_ms": 373280,
      "text": "反正走这个会阴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 373280,
      "end_ms": 374160,
      "text": "然后上去啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 374160,
      "end_ms": 376200,
      "text": "这个这个过程实际上是这样的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 376200,
      "end_ms": 377960,
      "text": "我们在走合适的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 377960,
      "end_ms": 379850,
      "text": "在换个方式再跟你们讲一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 379850,
      "end_ms": 383250,
      "text": "就是说上去要用文火上去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 383250,
      "end_ms": 384370,
      "text": "文火上去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 384370,
      "end_ms": 385250,
      "text": "文火是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 386290,
      "end_ms": 388850,
      "text": "这个文火就是意念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 389210,
      "end_ms": 392130,
      "text": "上次要用这个慢慢慢慢意念什么慢慢意念啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 392130,
      "end_ms": 397640,
      "text": "就是啊就是说跟他讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 397640,
      "end_ms": 403360,
      "text": "就是咳这个要要作为后天浊气的这些就是庸才"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 403360,
      "end_ms": 404860,
      "text": "这个时候他还是庸才"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 404860,
      "end_ms": 406400,
      "text": "庸碌的人才"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 406400,
      "end_ms": 409590,
      "text": "庸人当中的还算是才干"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 409590,
      "end_ms": 413870,
      "text": "这些庸才呢你要用文火去慢慢引诱着他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 413870,
      "end_ms": 418240,
      "text": "就是说来我这里来这个这个革命团体当中啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 418240,
      "end_ms": 420080,
      "text": "或者革命组织当中是可以发展的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 420080,
      "end_ms": 421060,
      "text": "有所发展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 421060,
      "end_ms": 422620,
      "text": "你有发展前景啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 422620,
      "end_ms": 424750,
      "text": "文火慢慢慢催动它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 424750,
      "end_ms": 426330,
      "text": "让他往上走"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 426330,
      "end_ms": 426830,
      "text": "往上走"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 426830,
      "end_ms": 429800,
      "text": "就是让他的视野越来越高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 429800,
      "end_ms": 431100,
      "text": "让他觉悟越来越高"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 431100,
      "end_ms": 433060,
      "text": "让他眼界越来越高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 433060,
      "end_ms": 436620,
      "text": "让他就是到去做高级工作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 436620,
      "end_ms": 439440,
      "text": "从一开始走下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 439440,
      "end_ms": 440920,
      "text": "从泥丸宫下到会阴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 440920,
      "end_ms": 444340,
      "text": "就是一开始是为为了把这些庸才"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 444340,
      "end_ms": 448280,
      "text": "这个从这个丹田催动出来的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 448280,
      "end_ms": 452690,
      "text": "你一开始还得用一些就是说比较世俗的"
